<title>UK: UK's Amstrad plans reconstruction.</title>
<headline>UK's Amstrad plans reconstruction.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British technology company Amstrad Plc said on Tuesday it was seeking approval from shareholders for a sweeping reconstruction.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the proposed revamp, shareholders would receive for each Amstrad share 163p nominal of loan notes exchangeable for cash, a share in newly-formed Viglen Technology and a pro-rata share in Betacom Plc.</p>
</text>
